# Citation metadata for this record (code and calculated data of the La-Fe-Si audit).
# Put this file in the root of the zip. Zenodo takes title and creators from the
# upload form, so enter the same values there. Update `doi`, `version` and
# `date-released` after the record exists.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these data, please cite the record below and the paper it supplements."
type: software
title: "La-Fe-Si CALPHAD audit: code and calculated data"
abstract: >
    Code and calculated data behind the paper "Reconstructing a published
    La-Fe-Si thermodynamic description from its printed tables: transcription
    errors, a descriptor test against microstructure data, and failed
    re-optimisation attempts". Contents: the merge builder for the binary
    assessments plus the printed ternary terms, the check of tau3-tau6, the
    B2/D03 ordering check, the driving-force descriptor with its 20-combination
    band, the pre-registered rank-correlation test against dark-phase area
    fractions from backscattered-electron images, the analysis scripts for the
    area fractions, and the scripts, frozen rules and summary results of the
    re-optimisation attempts. Every file is listed with its sha256 value in
    HASHES.txt. Database files, the transcribed tables of the literature and
    the microscopy images are not included.
authors:
  - given-names: "Iliya Angelov"
    family-names: "Radulov"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8943-5083"
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"

# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXXX"   # version DOI of this record, added after publication
version: v1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"        # set to the day the record is published
license: MIT

